    "detailed_description": "DISCLAMER:<br />\r\nIf you're looking for stunning visual effects, I'm afraid that you will have to look elsewhere..<br />\r\nHowever:<br />\r\nIf you're looking for some interesting dice-chucking fun, please read on:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKnights of Dice is a dice-rolling game, which aims to please gamers that are into boardgames, turnbased games, and strategy with a sprinkle of action.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeaturing:<br />\r\n- Dice rolling fun where you build attributes - will you use the powerful 6 and risk discarding the rest of your dice? Or will you play it safe, and use a poor dice.<br />\r\n- Strategic building of attributes which are used in another part of the game.<br />\r\n- Chain bonusses for maximum effect.<br />\r\n- Upgrades, potions, enemies, special-blocks and much more...",
